WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.286
Use bohr coordinates, an XY plane through the origin, and a 4 by 4 bohr

00:00:09.286 --> 00:00:13.000
section with 81 by 81 samples.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Use a fixed range from minus 0.45 to plus 0.45. The zero contour separates

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
negative and positive values.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.217
The signed contour image and plane CSV describe the same section. The profile

00:00:28.217 --> 00:00:33.000
runs along x from minus four to plus four bohr.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:39.600
The profile has 81 rows and covers 4.2334 angstroms. Both endpoints are

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:44.000
outside the grid and have blank value cells.
